Case 1: Normal Delivery Flow
    Solid Blue: waiting for order
    Solid Yellow: notice to move
    Blinking Green: moving 2 feet
    Solid Green: ready for pick up
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
    Blinking Green: moving to home
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
    Solid Blue: waiting for order

Case 2: Obstacle/Yielding interaction
    Solid Blue: waiting for order
    Solid Yellow: notice to move
    Blinking Green: moving 2 feet
        Blinking Yellow: uses lidar to stop if an object is within 1 foot, then moves once the path is clear.
        Lidar only stops the robot; it does not steer or move the robot.
    Solid Green: ready for pick up
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
    Blinking Green: moving to home
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
    Solid Blue: waiting for order

Case 3: Failed Pickup/Timeout Recovery    
    Solid Blue: waiting for order
    Solid Yellow: notice to move
    Blinking Green: moving 2 feet
    Solid Green: ready for pick up
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
        Loops: repeats audio every 15 seconds showing the user did not pick up the object.
        Timeout: returns home if pickup is not confirmed after 45 seconds.
    Blinking Green: moving to home
        Audio Cue: no speech, sound only
    Solid Blue: waiting for order

